# nvh test-gen demo — record with: vhs docs/recordings/testgen-demo.tape

Output docs/screenshots/testgen-demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20

Type "# nvHive Test Generation — AI writes tests that verify themselves"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "nvh test-gen nvh/core/council.py"
Enter
Sleep 25s
